     instance basis to dynamically override the default configuration.  The
     '#' below must be replaced with the driver instance / interface unit num‐
     ber:

     _d_e_v_._b_x_e_._#_._d_e_b_u_g
             DEFAULT = 0
             Sets the default logging level of the driver instance.  See
             _h_w_._b_x_e_._d_e_b_u_g above and the Diagnostics and Debugging section be‐
             low for more details.

     _d_e_v_._b_x_e_._#_._r_x___b_u_d_g_e_t
             DEFAULT = 0xffffffff
             Sets the maximum number of receive packets to process in an in‐
             terrupt for the driver instance.  See _h_w_._b_x_e_._r_x___b_u_d_g_e_t above for
             more details.

